{
  "comment": [
    "JNI callbacks/fields of java.desktop (libawt / libfontmanager / libjavase jpeg) plus the",
    "java.lang entry points those libraries call back into, for Beangle native images.",
    "Collected with the GraalVM 25 native-image tracing agent by running the OTK service on the JVM and",
    "exercising /captcha/image, /code/qr, /code/bar, /doc/excel, /doc/pdf and /lang/en/check.",
    "Two agent runs are folded in: one with a populated ~/.java/fonts cache (which exercises the",
    "BufferedImage/ColorModel/raster/JPEG-ImageIO paths) and one with an empty -Duser.home, which forces",
    "sun.font.FcFontConfiguration to synthesise the font configuration and therefore exercises the",
    "sun.font.FontConfigManager JNI entry points.",
    "JDK version bound: verified with GraalVM for JDK 25 (25.3.4.1).",
    "sun.font.Font2D uses charToGlyphRaw/charToVariationGlyphRaw on JDK 25; JDK 21 only has charToGlyph/charToVariationGlyph.",
    "The ICU data glob keeps the version segment as '*' because it changes per JDK (icudt72b on 21, icudt76b on 25).",
    "Re-collect and re-verify (javap, strings libawt.so | grep g_CM) on every JDK or GraalVM upgrade.",
    "The foreign section registers the FFM (Panama) downcalls/upcalls of JDK 25 sun.font.HBShaper:",
    "since JDK 24 HarfBuzz is the default text layout engine and reaches libharfbuzz through the",
    "foreign-function API, so every downcall needs an explicit entry (getDowncallStubPointer fails",
    "with MissingForeignRegistrationError otherwise).  Also collected by the tracing agent.",
    "sun.font.HBShaper.getFontTableData must stay registered: createFace() resolves it with",
    "MethodHandles.lookup().findStatic and swallows the failure, so an unregistered method yields",
    "a null HarfBuzz face and TextLayout silently returns a zero-advance, empty-glyph layout.",
    "That made /captcha/image render a blank JPEG while plain Graphics2D.drawString still worked."
  ],
